# An allowlist: nothing enters the build context unless it is named here, so a stray local file
# (an `.env`, a key, `.ink/` output) cannot reach an image layer. `cargo xtask layout` fails when
# this file does not start with `*`, or leaves out a workspace member or a root file the build reads.
*

# Root files
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!clippy.toml
!rustfmt.toml
!.cargo

# The crates of the workspace, by their top folder, and the WIT worlds they bind
!blob
!build
!cli
!clock
!config
!control
!db
!diag
!edge
!engine
!fixture
!freehand
!freehand-web
!host
!model
!plugin
!queue
!secret
!token
!watch
!tools
!wit
!xtask

# Local state inside an allowed folder
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/.ink/
**/*.snap.new
**/*.pending-snap
